# The index already holds LF for every tracked text file (verified: git ls-files --eol
# shows zero CRLF blobs), so this changes no blob. What it changes is a Windows checkout:
# 118 files stop arriving as CRLF, which is what makes a Node-side text comparison
# platform-dependent. git diff normalises both sides and never saw it.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.docx binary
